      "passageSha256": "94651873189baf81f9304a3215e804aac11afb93970661b575ebce45f9d87554",
      "pdfPages": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0089",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-s002",
      "sentenceText": "New York Times reporter Alex Williams concludes, “No matter how many friends you make, a sense of fatalism can creep in: the period for making B.F.F.’s, the way you did in your teens or early 20s, is pretty much over.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2016ea3adcf0aa68d72d8932d15542f4a5ce431a739f5d81f60c86b05c5248de",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a8090183d30ee029c3592b55b3ff7759515413f8faf549249dfa9570a236624",
      "passageSha256": "94651873189baf81f9304a3215e804aac11afb93970661b575ebce45f9d87554",
      "pdfPages": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0090",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-s004",
      "sentenceText": "At work, you might get close to someone from being on the same project.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3fc02d2b5e066cdb98013050041f96dffef746a4119619fb66825f36e8853891",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a8090183d30ee029c3592b55b3ff7759515413f8faf549249dfa9570a236624",
      "passageSha256": "94651873189baf81f9304a3215e804aac11afb93970661b575ebce45f9d87554",
      "pdfPages": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0091",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-s005",
      "sentenceText": "But, unless you are on the same project with this person again, it’s hard to stay in touch.",
      "sentenceSha256": "42d055d411c79ac1b39d3a5fcaf703e0a103279e16efbf4813dafd86fa647810",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "fdb487e471c13cf7754624a035b6f5cb44ed674c2629b1f4c053b45eeb7694c0",
      "passageSha256": "aff3577ed439068953a2141ea8fcf28b99b4a2201533de564f97846b58ff6a73",
      "pdfPages": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0092",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-s007",
      "sentenceText": "If you have a partner, then your partner must like any new friends, too, which makes it even harder.",
      "sentenceSha256": "584b1fa9ddccad2ac0275802f3dbbe17cc3cdadc48e844ae9657c8f85806aeb5",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s05-p075-04770-r007-009",
